  "subject": "Finaliza\u00E7\u00E3o do Pedido de Fornecimento \u2013 Refer\u00EAncia de Lote: H80-26-0155 \u2013 Apresenta\u00E7\u00E3o de Pre\u00E7os e Confirma\u00E7\u00E3o de Especifica\u00E7\u00F5es.",
  "from": "\u0022Da Silva\u0022 \u003Cinfo@dalidioman.ooguy.com\u003E",
  "to": "encomendas@globalbrico.pt",
  "date": "Mon, 20 Jul 2026 11:34:35 \u002B0000",
  "text": "",
  "html": "\u003C!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \u0022-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\u0022 \u0022http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003CHTML\u003E\u003CHEAD\u003E\n\u003CMETA name=GENERATOR content=\u0022MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001\u0022\u003E\u003C/HEAD\u003E\n\u003CBODY style=\u0022MARGIN: 0.5em\u0022\u003E\n\u003CP\u003EOl\u0026aacute;,\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003ESou Da Silva e entro em contato em nome da nossaexport.com. Temos interesse em seus produtos e em sua expertise.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003EEste \u0026eacute; o nosso primeiro contato oficial e buscamos estabelecer uma parceria comercial s\u0026oacute;lida e de longo prazo com voc\u0026ecirc;s.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003EAnalisamos o site de voc\u0026ecirc;s e solicitamos, por meio desta, pre\u0026ccedil;os com desconto para os itens listados no arquivo em anexo, a fim de realizarmos um pedido em grande quantidade o mais breve poss\u0026iacute;vel.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003EAl\u0026eacute;m disso, gostar\u0026iacute;amos de falar diretamente com o departamento de vendas para cadastrar sua equipe em nosso sistema e enviar nosso pedido de compra assim que recebermos seu retorno.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003ESe poss\u0026iacute;vel, tamb\u0026eacute;m gostar\u0026iacute;amos de agendar uma reuni\u0026atilde;o com sua equipe ap\u0026oacute;s o envio do pedido de compra para discutirmos melhor nossas necessidades.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP\u003EPor favor, verifique o arquivo com todas as especifica\u0026ccedil;\u0026otilde;es. Aguardamos seu retorno ainda hoje.\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: monospace; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\u0022\u003E\n\u003CSPAN style=\u0027FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \u0022times new roman\u0022, times, serif\u0027\u003E\u003CSTRONG\u003EKind regards | Com os melhores cumprimentos,\u003C/STRONG\u003E\u003C/SPAN\u003E\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: monospace; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\u0022\u003E\n\u003CSPAN style=\u0027FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \u0022times new roman\u0022, times, serif\u0027\u003E\u003CSTRONG\u003EDomingos Da Silva\u003C/STRONG\u003E\u003C/SPAN\u003E\u003CBR\u003E\u003CSPAN style=\u0027FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \u0022times new roman\u0022, times, serif\u0027\u003EAssistente Comercial\u003C/SPAN\u003E\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: monospace; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial\u0022\u003E\n\u003CSPAN style=\u0027FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \u0022times new roman\u0022, times, serif\u0027\u003ENIF: 5002151367\u003C/SPAN\u003E\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: monospace; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-C